    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire off turd after turd to merge them together for points! Use bathroom powers to assist in keeping the bowl from overflowing! Increase your score to drop bigger and bigger turds and receive more power ups along the way! Relax and have a laugh as you rack up points to see how far you can last in this wacky merging/combiner game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-hand-drawn cartoon poop </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-flatulence and other gross sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-potty-humor</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire off turd after turd to merge them together for points! Use bathroom powers to assist in keeping the bowl from overflowing! Increase your score to drop bigger and bigger turds and receive more power ups along the way! Relax and have a laugh as you rack up points to see how far you can last in this wacky merging/combiner game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-hand-drawn cartoon poop </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-flatulence and other gross sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-potty-humor</p>",
    "short_description": "Take the browns to the super bowl in this goofy merger/combiner game that no one asked for! If you enjoy casual click and drag, scoring lots of points, poop, and flatulence, then this is a game you can't miss!",
